        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-917] The SECC shall respond with DC_CableCheckRes containing \"ResponseCode = OK\" within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 215, if the SECC measures a CP State C or D.",
