        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In the discharging services, EVCC and SECC shall align to IEC 61851-1 signalling in the same way as in the charging services. Until the discharging service is added in IEC 61851-1, it is defined as an extension within this document. Basic status definitions between charging and discharging are similar, but trigger conditions for charging and discharging loops are defined for reverse power transfer system. It shall be given by HLC control under the condition of IEC 61851-1 signalling agreement.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                922,
                1121,
                1054
